# Complexity
- Time complexity: $$O(n)$$

- Space complexity: $$O(n)$$

# Code
```java []
class Solution {
    public int[] productExceptSelf(int[] nums) {
        int totalProduct = 1;
        int cntZeroes = 0;

        for (int num : nums) {
            if (num != 0) {
                totalProduct *= num;
            } else {
                cntZeroes++;
            }
        }

        int[] res = new int[nums.length];

        for (int i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {
            if (cntZeroes == 0) {
                res[i] = totalProduct / nums[i];
            } else if (cntZeroes == 1) {
                if (nums[i] == 0) {
                    res[i] = totalProduct;
                } else {
                    res[i] = 0;
                }
            } else {
                res[i] = 0;
            }
        }

        return res;
    }
}
```
